  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nLet's interchanged the two signs one by one to make the given equation mathematically correct.\n\n1) × and ÷\n\n⇒ 128 - 8 + 96 × __**16 ÷ 20**__ = 16 \n\n⇒ 128 - 8 + __**96 × 0.8 **__= 16\n\n⇒ __**128**__ - 8 __**+ 76.8**__ = 16\n\n⇒ 204.8 - 8 = 16\n\n⇒ 196.8 ≠ 16\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n2) - and +\n\n⇒ 128 + 8 - __**96 ÷ 16**__ × 20 = 16 \n\n⇒ 128 + 8 - __**6 × 20**__ = 16\n\n⇒ __**128 + 8 **__- 120 = 16\n\n⇒ **__136 - 120__ **= 16\n\n⇒ 16 = 16\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\n3) - and ×\n\n⇒ 128 × 8 + __**96 ÷ 16**__ - 20 = 16 \n\n⇒ __**128 × 8**__ + 6 - 20 = 16\n\n⇒ __**1024 + 6**__ - 20 = 16\n\n⇒ __**1030 - 20**__ = 16\n\n⇒ 1010 ≠ 16\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) + and ÷\n\n⇒ 128 - __**8 ÷ 96**__ + 16 × 20 = 16 \n\n⇒ 128 - 0.0833 + __**16 × 20 **__= 16\n\n⇒ 128 - 0.0833 + 320 = 16\n\n⇒ 448 - 0.0833\n\n⇒ 447.9167\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"- and +\"**",
